       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TINVMTED.
       AUTHOR.        K MOVSESIAN.
       INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  OCT 31, 1985.

      *REMARKS.       INVOICE PROCESSING.

      *D* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
      *D*                                                           *
      *D*   T I N V M T E D - INVOICE MONTH END SUMMARY REPORT      *
      *D*                                                           *
      *D*   THIS PROGRAM PRODUCES TWO SUMMARY REPORTS               *
      *D*   THE FIRST PAGE CONTAINS A MONTHLY TOTAL OF ALL ACCRUED  *
      *D*   TAXES BY TAX LOCATION.  THE SECOND REPORT SHOWS TOTAL   *
      *D*   MONTHLY PAYMENTS TO ACCOUNTS PAYABLE (NET DUE VENDOR),  *
      *D*   ACCRUED TAX, CASH DISCOUNTS,                            *
      *D*   AND COLLECT FREIGHT.  THE USER HAS THE REPORT OPTION    *
      *D*   OF SELECT WHICH MONTH THE REPORT SHOULD BE RAN AGAINST  *
      *D*   THE MATCH ON MONTH IS DONE BY MANIFEST NUMBER.          *
      *D*   THIS REPORT USES XRSCREEN TO HANDLE USER OPTIONS.       *
      *D*   SUBROUTINES CALLED                                      *
      *D*          1) THDRPRT                                       *
      *D*          2) GETFNUM                                       *
      *D*                                                           *
      *D*                                                           *
      *D*     XRSCREEN REPORT NO. - 14                              *
      *D*     REPORT HEADER       - HDR14.PUB                       *
      *D*     FORM NAME IN FRSCREEN - FINVMTED                      *
      *D*     AR11 KEY ON ACCOUNTS PAYABLE MENU (UDCAP.PUB)         *
      *D*                                                           *
      *D* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
      *C* CHANGES
      *C*
      *C* JULY 9, 1992  CR KALMAN   REQUEST:6234
      *C* ADDED CHANGE FOR VALLEYFIELD (629) ONLY. THEY NEEDED TO
      *C* KEEP TRACK OF DOLLARS PAID FOR A NEW TAX (QST/TVQ).
      *C* PREVIOUSLY THEY HAD ONLY GST. SINCE TOTAL TAX PAID IS
      *C* STORED (INV-ADD-TAX) AND GST PAID IS STORED (INV-ADD-GST)
      *C* SUBTRACTION WOULD GIVE THE TOTAL QST/TVQ PAID. THIS
      *C* INFORMATION NOW APPEARS ON THIS REPORT.
      *C*
      *C* CR KALMAN        4/26/94            REQUEST 6490
      *C* REMOVED PORTABLILITY COPYLIBS.
      *C*
      *C* JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C* ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C*
      *C* JULY 15, 1996   CA YODER
      *C* RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.


       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.          I-O-FEEDBACK     IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                               LOCAL-DATA       IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA
                               C01 IS NEW-PAGE.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
      *------ FOR IBM ONLY ------*
           SELECT MPLTINFO-PK-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DINVRCD-RG-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

      *------ FOR IBM ONLY ------*

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  PRINT-FILE
           DATA RECORD IS PRINT-REC.
       01  PRINT-REC                PIC X(132).

       FD  MPLTINFO-PK-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-PK-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  DINVRCD-RG-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DINVRCD-RG-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS2500  OF MCFLCS2501.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  PAGE-CTR                  PIC S9(4) BINARY  VALUE 0.
       77  HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG        PIC X  VALUE "Y".
9406CK 01  SCOPE   PIC X.

      *
      * FILE STATUS DEFINITION FOR AS/400 DB CALLS OR HP KSAM CALLS
      *
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X.

       01  NO-CHECK-SW              PIC X   VALUE "N".
           88  NO-CHECK-INV                 VALUE "Y".

